<title>USA: Harrah's Entertainment names Reed CFO.</title>
<headline>Harrah's Entertainment names Reed CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino company Harrah's Entertainment Inc said Monday it had named Colin Reed as chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>It said Reed will replace Charles Ledsinger, who resigned to join St. Joe Corp, a diversified company focused on real estate operations and based in Jacksonville, Fla.</p>
<p>Reed will also maintain his title and responsibilities as corporate executive vice president, which he held before being promoted, the company said.</p>
</text>
